        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Hayley Williams, Terry Glaze, Zac Farro, Taylor York, Josh Farro\n- Bands: Paramore, Lord Tracy, Pantera\n- Songs and Albums: \"Pressure\", All We Know Is Falling\n- Roles: singer, songwriter, musician, guitarist, vocalist\n\nFacts:\n- Terry Glaze, born on November 29, 1964 in Columbus, is a Texas-raised singer and guitarist known for his work in the American heavy metal bands Lord Tracy and Pantera.\n- Hayley Williams, born on December 27, 1988, is an American singer, songwriter, and musician.\n- Paramore consists of Hayley Williams, Zac Farro, and Taylor York.\n- All songs on All We Know Is Falling were written by vocalist Hayley Williams and guitarist Josh Farro.\n- \"Pressure\" is a song by the American rock band Paramore that was released on August 2, 2005 as the band's debut single from their debut studio album All We Know Is Falling.",
